        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:2939.026123046875,406.2384033203125,433.6181640625,4009.4490966796875",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "margin",
          "value": "<p>Please inform the elder Abu \u038a-Fadl b. Salman that I went to see Yuhanna (spelled yhri), I and the elder Abu Sahl, and gave him the letter, but he did not answer it. Until now I have been reminding him, to find out what he would say. If I get something from Yuhanna, I shall send it to him.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
